# Where the lead form POSTs submissions as JSON: { name, phone, service, message, page, submittedAt }.
# Use your own backend or a form service. Leave empty in development to simulate success.
# WARNING: every VITE_* value is bundled into public JavaScript. Never put bot tokens,
# API keys or passwords here; keep them on the server that receives this request.
VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=
